    "reviews": "\u201cA dystopian steampunk golf game.\u201d PERRRRRR-DOOIIIIIIIINNGGG! My heart\u2019s back up where it belongs!\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cI think it's safe to say that Vertiginous Golf is one of the most unique mini-golf titles I've ever played, and its steampunk setting is the real capper to such an off-the-wall and rich concept. I'm quite fond of its approach to narrative within a mini-golf game.\u201d<br>Destructiod<br><br>\u201cIts puzzling, challenging, and deeply weird characteristics make for a unique and engaging experience that brings new life to the staidest of sports\u201d<br>7 \u2013 GameSpot<br>",
